02:43.895 --> 02:46.062
That's okay, I got free curly fries.

02:46.104 --> 02:48.258
Okay, let's see what Meg got me.

02:48.300 --> 02:50.460
A crock pot?

02:50.502 --> 02:52.762
Things about to get crazy!

02:52.804 --> 02:55.359
You can cook a pork
tenderloin under your bed.

02:55.401 --> 02:56.696
