03:01.713 --> 03:03.339
Me? Meg Griffin.

03:03.381 --> 03:04.631
Would you mind standing up?

03:06.001 --> 03:07.844
Whoa! What-what-what are you doing?

03:07.886 --> 03:09.145
My God.

03:09.187 --> 03:10.380
The magic ratio.

03:10.422 --> 03:11.681
What's that?

03:11.723 --> 03:13.116
It means your ankles, calves, and thighs

03:13.158 --> 03:15.018
