03:15.060 --> 03:17.351
How would you like to try out
for the roller derby team?

03:17.393 --> 03:18.355
Really?

03:18.397 --> 03:20.723
- Do it, Meg.
- Yeah, Meg. You should totally do it.

03:20.765 --> 03:22.492
Meg's talking to a boy!

03:22.534 --> 03:24.678
Okay, sure. What the heck?

03:24.720 --> 03:26.429
Here. Take my card.

03:26.471 --> 03:28.832
"I am a registered sex offender."

03:28.874 --> 03:30.066
Flip it over.

03:30.108 --> 03:32.001
see other side."

03:32.043 --> 03:32.999
Give me that.

03:33.041 --> 03:34.334
