Brigitte Nielsen drunk
in a Burbank park.

14:32.172 --> 14:35.615
All right, time to greet the day.

14:35.657 --> 14:37.751
Are you living in a truck?

14:37.793 --> 14:40.420
Not bad. I see you got a
Hooters calendar in here.

14:40.462 --> 14:41.855
How do you get anything done

14:41.897 --> 14:44.157
with those rocking
knockers staring at you?

14:44.199 --> 14:45.692
Hey, who says I get anything done?

14:45.734 --> 14:47.727
Guy talk, guy talk. Yeah, guy talk.

14:47.769 --> 14:49.929
Guy talk. This is how guys talk.

14:49.971 --> 14:51.398
Oh, Peter, this is awful.

14:51.440 --> 14:52.632
Well, I love it.

14:52.674 --> 14:54.234
And I'm not going back in that house

14:54.276 --> 14:56.536
and listen to Lois tell me
how fat and unhealthy I am.

14:56.578 --> 14:58.304
You do look like you've put on a few.

14:58.346 --> 15:00.073
Your elbows are starting to pucker.

15:00.115 --> 15:01.925
Yeah, I mean, are you
really happy in here?

15:01.967 --> 15:03.243
You bet I am.

15:03.285 --> 15:05.263
I'm happier than a squash on Halloween.

15:07.015 --> 15:09.716
Dad, are they coming
to take us away, too?

15:09.758 --> 15:11.384
No, son, we're fine.

15:11.426 --> 15:12.770
How about on Thanksgiving?

15:13.295 --> 15:15.273
You know what, just enjoy the month.

15:27.327 --> 15:31.771
You're going down, Griffin,
like my stepfather's pants!

15:31.813 --> 15:33.740
I guess I see where some
of your anger comes from.

15:36.703 --> 15:38.269
Oh, no. This is bad.

15:43.843 --> 15:46.352
That's it. I have to do something.

15:46.394 --> 15:48.421
Chris, what are you doing?

15:48.463 --> 15:51.324
Saving my...

15:53.602 --> 15:55.962
Oh, my God. Chris, are you okay?

15:56.004 --> 15:58.531
I don't think so. I'm hurt pretty bad,

15:58.573 --> 16:00.834
like that time I was
running with scissors.

16:03.345 --> 16:05.263
You run like a girl.

16:09.135 --> 16:11.316
Run like a man, you get a suit.

16:14.908 --> 16:16.916
Here you go. And if you'd
like to put your e-mail

16:16.958 --> 16:18.418
on our sign-up list,

16:18.460 --> 16:20.353
I'd be happy to sell
it to Russian hackers.

16:20.395 --> 16:22.188
Peter, Peter, it's happening.

16:22.230 --> 16:23.990
What? The Bing Maps car.

16:24.032 --> 16:26.192
It's three blocks down and
it's coming this way.

16:26.234 --> 16:28.728
Holy crap. This is the day
we've been waiting for.

16:28.770 --> 16:30.497
We said we're gonna stand
in our front yards

16:30.539 --> 16:33.166
and wave as it goes by so
we're on the street view.

16:33.208 --> 16:35.034
We're gonna be on the Internet.

16:35.076 --> 16:37.170
Mort just called. It went by his house.

16:37.212 --> 16:39.339
Everybody, places! Start waving.

16:39.381 --> 16:41.432
This is not a drill!

16:46.061 --> 16:48.103
Damn it. I can't fit through the door.

16:48.145 --> 16:49.537
I'm stuck in the truck.

16:49.579 --> 16:50.950
What? What are you talking about?

16:50.992 --> 16:54.220
I knew this would happen.
You're too fat to get out.

16:54.262 --> 16:56.347
I see it. I see the Bing car.

16:58.318 --> 17:00.927
Oh, my God, Bing! Bing! Over here! Bing!

17:00.969 --> 17:02.212
They can't see you, Peter.

17:02.254 --> 17:03.630
You're facing away from the street.

17:03.672 --> 17:06.324
Stop talking, Quagmire. Just smile.

17:08.962 --> 17:10.904
This is amazing.

17:10.946 --> 17:12.438
Crap. Is it gone?

17:12.480 --> 17:14.607
The driver nodded at me.

17:14.649 --> 17:17.277
I... I think I'm gonna cry.

17:17.319 --> 17:19.579
Damn it. I can't believe I missed it.

17:19.621 --> 17:21.214
Jeez, I hope I don't
end up stuck in here

17:21.256 --> 17:22.715
like Winnie the Pooh.

17:22.757 --> 17:24.517
Uh, Rabbit?

17:24.559 --> 17:28.454
Perhaps you should push with
your shoulder and not your fist?

17:28.496 --> 17:30.381
Don't worry about it.

17:35.304 --> 17:37.890
Hey, did that big "boomba
boomba" nurse come in here?

17:37.932 --> 17:39.032
Uh, no.

17:39.074 --> 17:42.063
But Dr. Hartman, is my
brother gonna be okay?

17:42.105 --> 17:43.403
That's her. That's her.

17:43.445 --> 17:44.438
Hi, Juanita.

17:44.480 --> 17:45.856
Hello, Doctor.

17:47.116 --> 17:48.633
Was that weird? Was I just weird?

17:48.675 --> 17:49.576
Kind of.

17:49.618 --> 17:51.220
You don't know. I was fine.

17:51.971 --> 17:54.948
Oh, Chris, I'm so sorry
you got hurt like this.

17:54.990 --> 17:57.417
Roller derby was the best thing
that ever happened to me.

17:57.459 --> 18:00.821
I finally felt like I was good
at something, I made friends...

18:00.863 --> 18:03.757
but seeing you like this,
I realize you were right.

18:03.799 --> 18:07.561
It's too dangerous.
So I'm going to quit.

18:07.603 --> 18:11.548
No, Meg. I got hurt because
I didn't belong out there,

18:11.590 --> 18:12.599
but you do.

18:12.641 --> 18:14.334
I watched you skate.

18:14.376 --> 18:17.027
You found your calling
and I believe in you.

18:17.069 --> 18:19.473
Now get back to that
rink and help your team

18:19.515 --> 18:21.642
win the championship it deserves.

18:21.684 --> 18:25.187
Really? I will. Thanks, Chris.

18:25.688 --> 18:28.148
<i>With the spirit in her heart renewed,</i>

18:28.190 --> 18:31.451
<i>Meg returned to the roller derby arena.</i>

18:31.493 --> 18:33.253
<i>I think she did all right,</i>

18:33.295 --> 18:36.990
<i>but no one will know for
sure because halfway through</i>

18:37.032 --> 18:38.992
<i>everyone stopped to watch some fat kid</i>

18:39.034 --> 18:43.163
<i>who was killing it on
Dance Dance Revolution.</i>

18:44.807 --> 18:47.491
<i>Dance, you fat bitch.</i>

18:50.363 --> 18:53.273
So tonight, we say to the
yellow-billed marsh finch...

18:53.315 --> 18:55.142
you're extinct.

18:55.184 --> 18:57.477
But, right now, we're getting
word of breaking news.

18:57.519 --> 18:59.943
We go live to Tricia
Takanawa with details.

18:59.985 --> 19:02.316
- Tricia?
- Tom, I'm standing here

19:02.358 --> 19:04.384
outside a Spooner Street home,

19:04.426 --> 19:07.988
where a local business owner
has apparently eaten himself

19:08.030 --> 19:10.190
into his own food truck.

19:10.232 --> 19:13.894
Oh. It appears they've
finally removed the roof.

19:13.936 --> 19:17.164
Nobody look. This is a
private, gross matter.

19:17.206 --> 19:21.301
Mr. Griffin, is this performance art

19:21.343 --> 19:23.870
or, uh, some sort of
political statement?

19:23.912 --> 19:26.206
Well, I'm kind of ticked
about condoms in porn,

19:26.248 --> 19:28.008
but this is unrelated.

19:28.050 --> 19:31.345
Oh, hey, Lois. I guess
you must be happy.

19:31.387 --> 19:34.214
Yeah, it's every girl's dream
to have her husband hoisted

19:34.256 --> 19:36.049
out of a food truck in a horse harness.

19:36.091 --> 19:39.522
No, look, I-I'm just
saying, you were right.

19:39.564 --> 19:41.522
I'm a big tub of lard,

19:41.564 --> 19:43.597
and you have every reason
to be ashamed of me.

19:43.639 --> 19:45.129
Ashamed of you?

19:45.171 --> 19:46.860
I-Is that really what you think?

19:46.902 --> 19:49.429
Well, yeah, you kept saying
how overweight I am.

19:49.471 --> 19:51.231
Peter, don't you get it?

19:51.273 --> 19:54.201
I only wanted you to eat
healthy because I love you,

19:54.243 --> 19:56.579
and I'm concerned about your health.

19:56.621 --> 20:00.040
I want you around for
as long as I'm around.

20:00.082 --> 20:02.903
Really? Well, I love you, too, Lois.

20:02.945 --> 20:04.911
I'm sorry I was such a jerk.

20:04.953 --> 20:07.839
I guess I could do without
eating so much junk,

20:08.290 --> 20:10.550
but I could never do without you.

20:11.085 --> 20:12.795
Oh, Peter.

20:13.796 --> 20:15.188
Ma'am, please step back.

20:15.230 --> 20:17.114
We have to wash him with a hose.

20:19.952 --> 20:22.045
Guys, look! Look! The Bing car is back.

20:22.087 --> 20:24.221
No. I'm not ready! I'm not ready!

20:27.427 --> 20:30.103
<i>Inspired by his love for Lois,</i>

20:30.145 --> 20:33.907
<i>Peter had steamed vegetables
and brown rice that evening,</i>

20:33.949 --> 20:37.577
<i>then ate like crap for
the rest of his life.</i>

20:37.619 --> 20:41.448
<i>Nonetheless, he was
immortalized on Bing Maps.</i>

20:42.858 --> 20:45.685
<i>Fat people are amusing to me.</i>

20:45.727 --> 20:48.064
<i>Hang there, you fat bitch.</i>

20:48.065 --> 21:49.065
Thank you for watching "Family Guy" on
www.FOX-fan.ru